IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `mca-court`

-- Magistrates Court Act 2004 (WA), ss 7, 8, 9, 10, 14, 16(4), 17, 23, 28, 29, 30, 33 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case, the Magistrates Court Regulations or the rules of court (not deposited).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad
-- gen_wa_magistrates-court-act-2004_baseline.py). Expected results were written by hand from the text.
--
-- Life facts are from the workbench scenario au/wa/cradle-to-grave-jake, event k062 (10 March 2036, Jake 29): thirteen
-- months of overtime paid at ordinary time by Sentinel under the Security Services Industry Award, taken to the Fair Work
-- Ombudsman and then to a small claim in the Magistrates Court; judgment for $4,100. The scenario cites the Fair Work Act
-- 2009 s 548 (small claims). That the claim was brought in the WA Magistrates Court sitting in Perth, and that Jake
-- represented himself, are assumptions; that s 548 reaches his claim is taken from that Act, not decided here. The other
-- fixtures are hypothetical comparators.

